Win Rate: {performance['win_rate']}% | Avg Win: {performance['avg_win']}% | Avg Loss: {performance['avg_loss']}%
Notes: {performance['notes']}

━━━━ YOUR TASK ━━━━
Generate a complete weekly swing trade report using EXACTLY this structure:

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
